cceptance case (plant a self-minted claim — refused), tracecheck 26/489 and 107 cases reproduced; README package sections (sessckpt, matjournal, crashgate) with test commands and no capability claim; LOGBOOK newest-first with all Story entries plus trunk's 3lt2xv. (8) Hygiene — changed_paths carry no __pycache__/.pyc/stray plants or restored mutant leftovers; gofmt/vet clean; go test ./internal/crashgate ./internal/sessckpt ./internal/matjournal ./internal/traceability/... -count=1 and -race green (crashgate's real-SIGKILL rows included); tracecheck and `cataloggen -adopted -output internal/catalog/catalog_gen.go -check` exit 0 on the exact tree.\n4|\n5|Method: isolated immutable probes only, never mutate the live Story worktree, index, branch or HEAD; no product edits, commits, checkpoints or integration; Curator go-testing-tools skill; all CI local; PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 for every harness; keep scratch small under .temp/TASK-260830-17ootk/ and delete candidate copies when done. Attach TASK-260830-17ootk_review-verdict-rev1.md and TASK-260830-17ootk_review-evidence-rev1.tar.gz (a real gzip archive), complete the live merged checklist, then accept_cr(TASK-260830-17ootk, revision=1, evidence=TASK-260830-17ootk_review-verdict-rev1.md) or hand off changes requested with P1/P2/P3 classes named. Model: muse-spark xhigh (codex reviewers are out of quota until 2026-09-19). Canonical CLI /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board.","final_result":true}}}
