{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ce57","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ae83-44da-79a0-be6d-cdb96bee744a"},"sequence":1414,"recorded_at":1780531400002823,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"43909339-e6a4-48a8-9111-b9f3b1e533e8","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"43909339-e6a4-48a8-9111-b9f3b1e533e8","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"43909339-e6a4-48a8-9111-b9f3b1e533e8"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0ae88-09aa-78b3-a524-48673fc4b600"},"task_id":"01a0ae88-09aa-78b3-a524-48673fc4b600","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0ae88-09aa-78b3-a524-48673fc4b600","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-2rqigd/worktree/internal/matjournal/recover.go`.\n(140 line(s) above)\n141|type RecoveryInput struct {\n142|\tBoundary    string\n143|\tPath        string\n144|\tProvider    ProviderProbe\n145|\tBridge      BridgeProbe\n146|\tMarker      string\n147|\tHost        string\n148|\tLeaseKnown  bool\n149|\tLeaseBefore LeaseIdentity\n150|\tLeaseAfter  LeaseIdentity\n151|\t// NativeKnown gates the native identity/binding comparison. It is\n152|\t// required only when the journal carries a provider transaction\n153|\t// or an adopted bridge binding; otherwise no native identity\n154|\t// exists to compare.\n155|\tNativeKnown  bool\n156|\tNativeBefore string\n157|\tNativeAfter  string\n158|\t// ExternalEffect describes the possibly executed external effect\n159|\t// the probes reconcile (for example \"bridge adopt may have\n160|\t// adopted the dormant manager\").\n161|\tExternalEffect string\n162|\t// MarkerBytes carries the probe-attested destination marker for\n163|\t// a workspace commit completion; PriorMarkerBytes carries its\n164|\t// predecessor link when non-null. Both validate through the\n165|\t// closed marker shape before anything binds them.\n166|\tMarkerBytes      []byte\n167|\tPriorMarkerBytes []byte\n168|\t// PredecessorsRestored and StagingRemoved are the probe-verified\n169|\t// rollback-closure facts.\n170|\tPredecessorsRestored bool\n171|\tStagingRemoved       bool\n172|}\n173|\n174|// Evidence is the Section 13.13 conformance record for one recovery\n175|// assessment: boundary ID, path, operation IDs, pre/post durable\n176|// facts, external effect and status probe, winning lease and native\n177|// identity before/after, the selected outcome, and the reason and\n178|// remediation satisfying that outcome. Parked and rollback assessments\n179|// persist durably as recovery.json; safe_retry establishes no new\n180|// durable fact beyond the journal and receipt it returns.\n181|type Evidence struct {\n182|\tMaterializationID string            `json:\"materialization_id\"`\n183|\tBoundary          string            `json:\"boundary\"`\n184|\tPath              string            `json:\"path\"`\n185|\tOperationIDs      map[string]string `json:\"operation_ids\"`\n186|\tPhaseBefore       string            `json:\"phase_before\"`\n187|\tPhaseAfter        string            `json:\"phase_after\"`\n188|\tReceiptPresent    bool              `json:\"receipt_present\"`\n189|\tProviderState     string            `json:\"provider_state\"`\n190|\tBridgeState       string            `json:\"bridge_state\"`\n191|\tExternalEffect    string            `json:\"external_effect\"`\n192|\tStatusProbe       string            `json:\"status_probe\"`\n193|\tLeaseBefore       LeaseIdentity     `json:\"lease_before\"`\n194|\tLeaseAfter        LeaseIdentity     `json:\"lease_after\"`\n195|\tNativeBefore      string            `json:\"native_before\"`\n196|\tNativeAfter       string            `json:\"native_after\"`\n197|\tSelected          Outcome           `json:\"selected\"`\n198|\tReason            string            `json:\"reason\"`\n199|\tRemediation       string            `json:\"remediation\"`\n200|\tDecidedAt         string            `json:\"decided_at\"`\n201|}\n202|\n203|// parkedFailure builds the blocking-reason Structured Error for a\n204|// parked assessment: the named code with retryable false (parked\n205|// ambiguity is never retry permission).\n206|func parkedFailure(code axerror.Code, message string, operation string) (*axerror.Error, error) {\n207|\tids := axerror.NoIDs()\n208|\tif operation != \"\" {\n209|\t\tparsed, err := scalar.ParseUUIDv7(operation)\n210|\t\tif err == nil {\n211|\t\t\tids = ids.WithOperation(parsed)\n212|\t\t}\n213|\t}\n214|\treturn axerror.New(axerror.Spec{\n215|\t\tVersion:   lastErrorVersion,\n216|\t\tCode:      code,\n217|\t\tMessage:   message,\n218|\t\tRetryable: false,\n219|\t\tIDs:       ids,\n220|\t\tDetails:   axerror.Details{},\n221|\t})\n222|}\n223|\n224|// rollbackFailure builds the terminal-reason Structured Error for an\n225|// executed rollback.\n226|func rollbackFailure(code axerror.Code, message string, operation string) (*axerror.Error, error) {\n227|\treturn parkedFailure(code, message, operation)\n228|}\n229|\n230|// Recover classifies one crashed materialization after a clean restart\n231|// into exactly one Section 13.13 outcome. It reads durable facts first\n232|// (journal, receipt, plan view), then applies the rejection gates in\n233|// order: unknown or moved authority, substitution, two live\n234|// authorities, unfenced continuation, host conditions, marker\n235|// integrity, unknown decisive status, and contradictory probes all\n236|// park. Rollback-required facts execute the allowed abort and return\n237|// explicit_rollback; provable terminal completions (commit, dormant\n238|// finalize, rollback close) apply and return safe_retry; every other\n239|// consistent assessment resumes or replays with safe_retry.\n240|//\n241|// Parked assessments record the blocking reason as last_error (except\n242|// on a terminal journal, which stays frozen) and persist the evidence\n243|// as recovery.json. Rollback assessments persist the terminal journal\n244|// and the evidence. Safe_retry assessments mutate nothing: the journal\n245|// and receipt they return are the evidence.\n246|func (store *Store) Recover(materializationID string, input RecoveryInput) (Outcome, Evidence, error) {\n247|\tid, err := checkUUIDv7(materializationID, \"materialization_id\")\n248|\tif err != nil {\n249|\t\treturn \"\", Evidence{}, err\n250|\t}\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
