iteInputs()\n104|\tcase \"direct_provider\":\n105|\t\treturn directProviderInputs()\n106|\tcase \"board_dormant\":\n107|\t\treturn boardDormantInputs()\n108|\tcase \"board_ownership\":\n109|\t\treturn boardOwnershipInputs()\n110|\tdefault:\n111|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"unknown closure %q\", closure)\n112|\t\treturn matjournal.CreateInputs{}\n113|\t}\n114|}\n115|\n116|// driveCheckpointCapture injects the crash at one capture seam,\n117|// restarts clean, and proves the identical retry converges on the\n118|// recorded checkpoint with its receipt: safe_retry by construction.\n119|// Capture is append-only and has no evaluator, rollback, or parked\n120|// semantics; the retry convergence is the outcome proof.\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
