"description\": \"Validate all 74 conformance records\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"records=74 complete=74 bad=[]\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 30,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 8,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
