ng else); digest pin enforced by passing tracecheck (107 cases, 26/489); self-minted claim refused; README/LOGBOOK correct.\n- AC coverage 4 of 4. Race green on all four packages; vet, gofmt, cataloggen check clean.\n\nAttached: `TASK-260830-17ootk_review-verdict-rev1.md` and `TASK-260830-17ootk_review-evidence-rev1.tar.gz` (probe log/code, mutant rerun scripts and summaries, suite/vet logs). Scratch copies deleted; candidate left uncommitted for handoff snapshot.","reason":null}}
